    "homepage": "https://wordpress.org/themes/agriculture-farm-lite/",
    "sections": {
        "description": "The Agriculture Farm theme is a beautifully crafted, free website template designed for farmers, agricultural entrepreneurs, and agribusinesses dedicated to sustainable, smart, and eco friendly farming. Perfect for showcasing everything from green farm practices and organic farming to hydroponic farming, dairy farming, organic food blog, vegetable gardening site, fruit orchard website, farm workshop portal or urban agriculture, this theme caters to both traditional and modern agriculture needs. Whether you’re running a small family farm, a permaculture farming initiative, or a tech-driven smart farming operation, this theme provides a professional platform to connect with your audience, promote products, or educate the public about your mission. With a clean, responsive layout, the theme features full-width banners, testimonials, customizable call-to-action buttons, and a well structured blog section perfect for sharing updates on sustainable farming, crop production, eco conscious farming, and more. It supports images, videos, and multiple content formats to highlight vertical farming, eco-agriculture, and soil health techniques. Built-in social media integration helps amplify your reach, while SEO-friendly code ensures discoverability. The theme is ideal for farmers looking to step into the digital world without high costs. Its easy customization options allow you to reflect your farm’s identity and values—be it regenerative farming, plant nurseries, greenhouse management, horticulture, farm product sales, livestock care, organic food shops, poultry farming, agri startups, agriculture blogs, or farm-to-table efforts. Perfect for blogs, portfolios, or online stores, this free theme empowers agricultural voices with elegance, functionality, and purpose. For added functionality, it works seamlessly with the Contact Form 7 plugin to help you collect inquiries and connect with customers directly."
    },
